# switcher_webapi

An aiohttp web service wrapping [aioswitcher](https://github.com/TomerFi/aioswitcher) for controlling Switcher smart devices via REST API.

## Tech Stack

- **Runtime**: Python 3.13+
- **Web framework**: aiohttp
- **Device communication**: aioswitcher
- **Linting/Formatting**: Ruff (configured in pyproject.toml)
- **Type checking**: mypy
- **Testing**: pytest with pytest-asyncio (auto mode), pytest-aiohttp
- **Docs**: MkDocs with Material theme
- **Container**: Multi-platform builds (amd64, arm/v7, arm64/v8)
